      <Capitolo>Repair procedure</Capitolo>
      <Corpo> &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;LI&gt; &lt;B&gt; Action: &lt;/B&gt; Proceed with the calibration of the phonic wheel &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;BR/&gt;  &lt;LI&gt; &lt;B&gt; Procedure: &lt;/B&gt; &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;BR/&gt; 1- Turn on the ignition &lt;BR/&gt; 2- Bring the engine up to operating temperature &lt;BR/&gt; 3- Rev the engine to over 5000 rpm for a few seconds &lt;BR/&gt; 4- Keep the engine idling for a few seconds &lt;BR/&gt; 5- Repeat steps 3 and 4 until the engine fault light goes out &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;BR/&gt; The phonic wheel is now correctly calibrated &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;LI&gt; &lt;B&gt; Note: &lt;/B&gt; - - &lt;BR/&gt; &lt;BR/&gt; </Corpo>
